 "title": "60 V N-channel NexFET power MOSFET, SON 5 mm × 6 mm",
 "source": {
  "revision": "SLPS388B, revised January 2015",
  "pages": 12
 },
 "summary": "A single N-channel power MOSFET rated for 60 V between drain and source, in a 5 mm by 6 mm eight-lead SON whose underside is one large drain pad. On-resistance at 18 A is 5.9 mΩ max with 10 V on the gate and 8.5 mΩ max with 4.5 V, and it is specified as logic level; total gate charge is 29 nC typical to 10 V, with 5.4 nC gate-to-drain. Intended uses are DC-DC converters, synchronous rectification on a supply's secondary side and motor control. It is avalanche rated, lead-free, RoHS compliant and halogen-free.",
 "key_figures": [
